      {
        "do": "message",
        "when": "pre",
        "level": "action",
        "text": "Before you run the installer, know what it does: installing KhiCAS ERASES every other flash application and language pack on the calculator, and fills the archive — it needs about 2.9 MB free and leaves 128 to 256 KB. "
      },
      {
        "do": "message",
        "when": "post",
        "level": "action",
        "text": "Three steps on the calculator, in this order. 1: run INST — on OS 5.5 or later, start arTIfiCE first ([prgm], choose A, [enter] twice) and launch INST from it; on OS 5.3 or earlier run prgmINST from [prgm]. The calculator resets when it finishes. 2: clear RAM, [2nd] [+], 7:Reset, 1:All RAM — this one matters, KhiCAS misbehaves without it. 3: delete the 43 AppIns appvars, which have done their job: [2nd] [+], 2:Mem Mgmt/Del, B:AppVars. KhiCAS then appears under [apps]."
      }
    ],
    "uninstall": [
      {
        "do": "message",
        "when": "post",
        "level": "action",
        "text": "The installer and any AppIns appvars still on the calculator have been removed. KhiCAS itself is a flash application and cannot be deleted over the cable, so remove it by hand: [2nd] [+], 2:Mem Mgmt/Del, A:Apps, put the cursor on KhiCAS and press [del]."
      }
    ]
